cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this atlas, please cite it as below."
title: "African HIV PrEP/PEP Long-Acting Trial Atlas: a methodology-calibration audit"
abstract: >-
  A calibration audit of African-cohort classification in long-acting HIV PrEP
  meta-analyses. Covers cabotegravir-LA, lenacapavir, and dapivirine ring trials
  pooled in MAs published 2020-2026. Pre-IRR finding (working): 35% sensitivity
  (95% CI 15-60%) at D3 ground truth (>=50% African enrolment).
